Commander Derik has begun the mission to rescue Prince Zarad, and we will go too. Arteres will guide the troops through the underground of Yagditha's fortress.

The fate of the Shogoth is very sad; Yagditha created them from the bodies of Pristonians killed in battle and of those captured by the Black Crystals you saw on the Shadow Road. Their souls are trapped under the control of the Sathla and Arhdyra. Celina wants to study their souls to find a way to free the Shogoth's souls from this suffering.

Collect the Blue Soul and the Red Soul by hunting Sathla and Arhdyra, respectively, and take them to Sage Celina in Pillai.
